/Title (development acrosscountries.The correlation analysisshows astrong positive relationship between male and female school enrollment \(0.97\), as well as between male and female life expectancy \(0.96\). These strong associations suggest that related indicators may reflect overlapping underlying patterns rather than entirely independent influences. Therefore, my analysis considers these variables alongside healthcare indicators and GDP per capita to gain a more comprehensive understanding of differences in life expectancy across countries.)
